JobHuntBot Online 0.2.0

This package is an independently implemented online adaptation inspired by the
workflow and safety boundaries of DanielPan12/JobHuntBot, which states that it
is adapted from Yvonne He's ApplyPilot. Their MIT notices are retained in
LICENSE.

Upstream reference:
https://github.com/DanielPan12/JobHuntBot

DeepSeek is an optional external AI provider integrated through its official
API. DeepSeek is not bundled, redistributed, or represented as part of this
software. Users supply and control their own API credential. Current official
integration endpoints and model identifiers are documented in taskpack/
DEPENDENCIES.md.

This package is not an official release of JobHuntBot, ApplyPilot, DeepSeek,
SEEK, LinkedIn, Indeed, or any applicant tracking system. It does not include,
request, or authorize access to third-party account passwords, cookies,
verification codes, or protected job-board data.
